<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts AMRESCO.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts AMRESCO.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential analyst Jonathan Adams said he started AMRESCO Inc with a buy rating and set a 12-month target price of $26.</p>
<p>-- He estimated the company would earn $0.33 a share in the current fourth quarter and $1.04 a share for the full 1996 year. In 1997, he projects AMRESCO will earn $1.55 per share.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
